// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
/* ── Element spec (built exactly as listed) ─────────────────────────────────
   y-axis         → Cylinder r0.030 black, y∈[-2.4,2.4] + Cone tip at +y
   w-axis         → Cylinder r0.030 black, w∈[-0.5,3.2] + Cone tip at +w
   x-axis         → Cylinder r0.030 black, x∈[-2.6,2.0] + Cone tip at +x
   tick at w=1    → Cylinder r0.026 black, short vertical bar
   w=0 plane      → BufferGeometry quad, MeshBasic #E3EDE9 op .55, DoubleSide
   w=1 plane      → 4 Cylinders r0.024 #66807C (outline only, unfilled)
   dot (x,y)      → Sphere r0.11 #EE1B18 + BackSide rim (draggable)
   connector      → Cylinder r0.013 #555 from (x,y,0) to (x,y,1)
   dot (x,y,1)    → Sphere r0.11 #EE1B18 + rim
   dashed ray     → pool of Cylinders r0.019 black, dash .15 / gap .12, origin→λ
   dot (λx,λy,λ)  → Sphere r0.11 #EE1B18 + rim (slider driven, λ=2.9 default)
